<item>
  <title>Most attention heads are doing nothing</title>
  <link>https://luisblancohoyos.com/posts/first-post/</link>
  <description><![CDATA[ 





<p>I’ve been poking at a 6-layer transformer. Attention entropy collapses hard after layer 4.</p>
